{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16979","headline":"奉和圣制重阳日即事 · 武元衡","name":"奉和圣制重阳日即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉烛降寒露，我皇歌古风。\n重阳德泽展，万国欢娱同。\n绮陌拥行骑，香尘凝晓空。\n神都自蔼蔼，佳气助葱葱。\n律吕阴阳畅，景光天地通。\n徒然被鸿霈，无以报玄功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}